  "prefLabel": "Liq 502.03 Service and Preparation of Food",
  "priorExpiration": "2004-11-28",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Liq 502.03 Service and Preparation of Food. A hotel full service restaurant licensee or his or her employees shall prepare, cook, and serve the food for the restaurant. In no case shall the food concession be leased or rented out to any other person.\n\nSource. (See Revision note at chapter heading for Liq 500) #5043, eff 1-11-91; ss and moved by #6391, eff 11-28-96 (formerly Liq 502.06), EXPIRED: 11-28-04\n\nNew. #8450, eff 10-21-05; ss by #10647, eff 7-24-14; ss by #13461, eff 10-13-22",
  "source": "https://github.com/GraniteState/adm-rules-data/blob/1c92d82e0f03a582ca5b7a578588edf38de2318e/raw/2026-11-15/state_agencies/liq100-1100.html"
